  abilityId: 811038
  abilityName: Paradoxically Palatable
  abilityDesc: 18 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    Injury, Weakness, Sickness, Paralysis infliction, 50% damage reduction for 3
    turns, damage taken may restore HP for 3 turns, damage taken fills BB gauge for
    3 turns & boosts own max HP
